{"source": "app_details", "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=304930&cc=us&l=english", "collected_at": "2026-10-14T01:24:32Z", "http_status": 200, "payload": {"304930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unturned", "steam_appid": 304930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [306460], "detailed_description": "<strong>SURVIVE THE APOCALYPSE</strong>: Scavenge for supplies, hunt for food, and build shelter in a world overrun by zombies.<br><br><strong>EXPLORE MASSIVE LEVELS</strong>: Travel by air, land, and sea while discovering hidden secrets and NPCs to help and trade with.<br><br><strong>BUILD YOUR HOME</strong>: Fortify your base before heading back out to retrieve airdrops, scout deadzones, and battle hordes of supernatural undead.<br><br><strong>COOPERATE OR FIGHT</strong>: Team up with friendly players to arrest the bandits, or face-off in intense PvP raids.<br><br><strong>TRULY FREE-TO-PLAY</strong>: No pay-to-win mechanics, only cosmetic items to further customize your character.<br><br><strong>ENDLESS CREATIVITY</strong>: Create, share, and experience custom maps and mods through the Steam Workshop.<br><br><strong>SOURCE CODE</strong>: From new features to total conversions, you can rebuild the game with source code and project files available on GitHub.", "about_the_game": "<strong>SURVIVE THE APOCALYPSE</strong>: Scavenge for supplies, hunt for food, and build shelter in a world overrun by zombies.<br><br><strong>EXPLORE MASSIVE LEVELS</strong>: Travel by air, land, and sea while discovering hidden secrets and NPCs to help and trade with.<br><br><strong>BUILD YOUR HOME</strong>: Fortify your base before heading back out to retrieve airdrops, scout deadzones, and battle hordes of supernatural undead.<br><br><strong>COOPERATE OR FIGHT</strong>: Team up with friendly players to arrest the bandits, or face-off in intense PvP raids.<br><br><strong>TRULY FREE-TO-PLAY</strong>: No pay-to-win mechanics, only cosmetic items to further customize your character.<br><br><strong>ENDLESS CREATIVITY</strong>: Create, share, and experience custom maps and mods through the Steam Workshop.<br><br><strong>SOURCE CODE</strong>: From new features to total conversions, you can rebuild the game with source code and project files available on GitHub.", "short_description": "Unturned is an open-world zombie survival sandbox game. As one of the few not yet turned, you must fight to remain among the living.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/304930/161ec2d6ace8a03afdb7a423510ff8f7d8b301ba/header.jpg?t=1783436894", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/304930/e0b5f0f12917ea6d64cb2ee82721380d1e4aa016/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783436894", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/304930/e0b5f0f12917ea6d64cb2ee82721380d1e4aa016/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783436894", "website": "https://smartlydressedgames.com/unturned/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> High Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8